stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INIT
    INIT --> SAFE_IDLE : boot complete / no hard faults
    SAFE_IDLE --> MANUAL_CONTROL : operator mode set / RC link healthy
    SAFE_IDLE --> AUTONOMOUS_CONTROL : autonomy start / autonomy ready + safety clear
    MANUAL_CONTROL --> AUTONOMOUS_CONTROL : autonomy engage / policy allows transfer
    AUTONOMOUS_CONTROL --> MANUAL_CONTROL : operator reclaim/override / override accepted
    INIT --> DEGRADED : subsystem fault / fault is recoverable
    SAFE_IDLE --> DEGRADED : subsystem fault / fault is recoverable
    MANUAL_CONTROL --> DEGRADED : subsystem fault / fault is recoverable
    AUTONOMOUS_CONTROL --> DEGRADED : subsystem fault / fault is recoverable
    E_STOP_LATCH --> DEGRADED : subsystem fault / fault is recoverable
    INIT --> E_STOP_LATCH : e-stop/fatal fault
    SAFE_IDLE --> E_STOP_LATCH : e-stop/fatal fault
    MANUAL_CONTROL --> E_STOP_LATCH : e-stop/fatal fault
    AUTONOMOUS_CONTROL --> E_STOP_LATCH : e-stop/fatal fault
    DEGRADED --> E_STOP_LATCH : e-stop/fatal fault
    DEGRADED --> SAFE_IDLE : fault cleared / re-entry checks pass
